BT /F2 18.00 Tf 52.00 730.00 Td (Offline Document Summarizer Project Guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 703.00 Td (Version covered: 0.3.0) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 677.00 Td (This document explains how the Offline Document Summarizer works, how the parts connect, and where to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 664.00 Td (make future feature changes. It is written for maintainers who need to understand the project quickly) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 651.00 Td (before modifying it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 52.00 625.00 Td (1. Project Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 594.00 Td (Offline Document Summarizer is a private Windows desktop app for extracting text from local documents) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 581.00 Td (and summarizing that text with a local language model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 555.00 Td (The key product promise is:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 529.00 Td (- Users can drop a document into the app.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 516.00 Td (- The app extracts text locally.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 503.00 Td (- Users can review and edit the extracted text.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 490.00 Td (- The app sends the text only to a local runtime.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 477.00 Td (- A local Gemma model streams a summary back into the UI.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 464.00 Td (- Users can save the summary as a local .txt file.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 438.00 Td (The app does not upload files, extracted text, summaries, or metadata to remote services.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 52.00 412.00 Td (2. Current Technology Stack) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 381.00 Td (The current stack is split into a desktop shell, a web UI, and a local backend.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 355.00 Td (| Layer | Technology | Purpose |) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 345.00 Td (| --- | --- | --- |) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 335.00 Td (| Desktop shell | Tauri 2 + Rust | Creates the Windows desktop app and starts the backend sidecar in ) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 325.00 Td (release builds. |) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 315.00 Td (| Frontend | React + TypeScript + Vite | Provides drag-and-drop UI, editable text, settings, setup ) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 305.00 Td (check, streaming summary display, and save button. |) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 295.00 Td (| Backend | Python + FastAPI | Handles local extraction, readiness checks, summarization orchestration, ) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 285.00 Td (streaming events, and local save fallback. |) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 275.00 Td (| Image OCR | Tesseract + pytesseract + Pillow | Extracts text from PNG, JPG, JPEG, and WEBP files. |) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 265.00 Td (| PDF extraction | pdfplumber, with pypdf fallback | Extracts selectable PDF text page by page. |) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 255.00 Td (| Local model runtime | Ollama | Runs `gemma:2b` locally through `http://127.0.0.1:11434`. |) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.00 Tf 60.00 245.00 Td (| Future model runtime | llama-cpp-python | Loads local GGUF files when llama.cpp mode is selected. |) Tj ET
