BT /F2 14.00 Tf 52.00 373.00 Td (4. Privacy and Offline Boundary) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 342.00 Td (The privacy design is intentional and should be protected when adding features.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 316.00 Td (Current local-only rules:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 290.00 Td (- The React UI calls only http://127.0.0.1:8765.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 277.00 Td (- The FastAPI backend binds only to 127.0.0.1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 264.00 Td (- Ollama calls go only to http://127.0.0.1:11434.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 251.00 Td (- OllamaRuntime rejects non-local Ollama hostnames.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 238.00 Td (- Files are uploaded only to the local backend process.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 225.00 Td (- Temporary uploaded files are deleted after extraction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 212.00 Td (- Summaries are saved to local disk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 199.00 Td (- Document chat uses the current extracted text and recent in-memory chat only.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 186.00 Td (- The My Documents library stores extracted text, summaries, and metadata under local) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 62.00 173.00 Td (outputs/documents/.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 147.00 Td (Do not add remote API calls for document content unless the user explicitly opts into a new feature) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 52.00 134.00 Td (and the privacy UI is updated.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 52.00 108.00 Td (5. High-Level Runtime Flow) Tj ET
